  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large claypot over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the ground beef and cook until browned, breaking it up with a spoon as it cooks.",
    "Add the flour and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Gradually add the beef broth, whisking to avoid lumps.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then add the red wine vinegar, dried thyme, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the dum and cook until they are tender.",
    "Season with additional salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Cook ground beef to an internal temperature of 71°C / 160°F (no longer pink in the middle) before serving."
